<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1787930103"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:40.384"><div begin="19.998" end="43.336" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="19.998" end="23.503" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.998" end="20.465">我住</span><span begin="20.465" end="20.988">在</span><span begin="20.988" end="21.671">抽</span><span begin="21.671" end="22.010">帧</span><span begin="22.010" end="22.709">的大</span><span begin="22.709" end="23.503">海</span></p><p begin="26.459" end="30.370" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.459" end="27.037">给你</span><span begin="27.037" end="27.649">最</span><span begin="27.649" end="28.629">温柔</span><span begin="28.629" end="29.234">的对</span><span begin="29.234" end="30.370">白</span></p><p begin="32.476" end="39.227" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.476" end="32.747">能</span><span begin="32.747" end="32.969">远</span><span begin="32.969" end="33.662">超你</span><span begin="33.662" end="34.275">的</span><span begin="34.275" end="34.597">期</span><span begin="34.597" end="35.338">待</span> <span begin="35.656" end="35.927">还</span><span begin="35.927" end="36.880">甘心被</span><span begin="36.880" end="38.218">你主</span><span begin="38.218" end="39.227">宰</span></p><p begin="39.501" end="43.336" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.501" end="42.121">就是少了点情</span><span begin="42.121" end="43.336">感</span></p></div><div begin="46.005" end="1:09.907" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="46.005" end="49.788" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.005" end="46.668">快承</span><span begin="46.668" end="47.089">认</span><span begin="47.089" end="47.716">对</span><span begin="47.716" end="48.051">我</span><span begin="48.051" end="48.414">的</span><span begin="48.414" end="48.828">依</span><span begin="48.828" end="49.788">赖</span></p><p begin="52.518" end="56.537" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.518" end="53.190">从聊</span><span begin="53.190" end="53.615">天</span><span begin="53.615" end="53.915">到<